self.KB_CONTENT["card:783588"]={"id":"card:783588","ty":"card","sourceId":"783588","title":"『新舊會計科目對應作業』中的『新上層科目類別(BAC.MA008)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"明細","keywords":["明細","科目","類別","分類"],"y":"other","answer":"* 1.統制帳戶 2.明細帳戶 3.獨立帳戶 4.分類，欄位僅做顯示。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:780480"]={"id":"card:780480","ty":"card","sourceId":"780480","title":"『IPSR18 SHIPPING INSTRUCTION(文字報表)』中的『列印公司抬頭 (C1)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"地址","keywords":["地址"],"y":"other","answer":"* 預設Y。* 列印公司抬頭時才要列印公司英文全名、英文地址一、英文地址二。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
